[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2880.15, "timestamp": "00:48:00", "text": "虽然身处企业界，但我仍然……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2884.63, "timestamp": "00:48:04", "text": "现在独立了，嗯，我自己也一样，所以即使"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2887.109, "timestamp": "00:48:07", "text": "如果事情是那样的话，那就没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2889.03, "timestamp": "00:48:09", "text": "工作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2892.23, "timestamp": "00:48:12", "text": "呃，现在我得处理所有事情了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2895.67, "timestamp": "00:48:15", "text": "我自己，还有，是哪台笔记本电脑？哦，我看到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2900.23, "timestamp": "00:48:20", "text": "我打算买这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2905.67, "timestamp": "00:48:25", "text": "G16 呃 棍子 呃 S 是流氓。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2910.069, "timestamp": "00:48:30", "text": "你领工资吗？没有。我是一名学生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2915.99, "timestamp": "00:48:35", "text": "我，呃，我辞掉了我的工作，呃，自由职业。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2919.51, "timestamp": "00:48:39", "text": "嗯，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2921.67, "timestamp": "00:48:41", "text": "四个月前，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2925.51, "timestamp": "00:48:45", "text": "四、五个月前。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2932.47, "timestamp": "00:48:52", "text": "是的，我靠这个赚了点钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2935.51, "timestamp": "00:48:55", "text": "自由职业之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2939.109, "timestamp": "00:48:59", "text": "更像是管理方面的问题。"}]